    "consumed": "Piranha Smash Primary",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>\n  Looks like smash but it's smash with a lime flavor. And a lower risk of\n  addiction.\n</p>\n<p><strong>Primary Effect</strong></p>\n<p>Dose lasts 4 hours.</p>\n<p>\n  The user feels happy and satisfied, receiving a temporary modifier of +2 to\n  the following skills\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Acting</li>\n  <li>Dance</li>\n  <li>Contortionist</li>\n  <li>Conversation</li>\n  <li>Human Perception</li>\n  <li>Persuasion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Secondary Effect (DV9)</strong></p>\n<p>\n  When the dose wears off, the user rolls\n  <strong>WILL + Resist Torture/Drugs + 1d10 against Secondary DV</strong>.\n</p>\n<p>If this fails, they take a -2 to the following skills</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Acting</li>\n  <li>Dance</li>\n  <li>Contortionist</li>\n  <li>Conversation</li>\n  <li>Human Perception</li>\n  <li>Persuasion</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
